# Emdad frontend UI stack

## Current stack (prefer these)

- React 18 + Vite + TypeScript + React Router
- Tailwind CSS v3 (already in repo — do not jump to v4 unless explicitly requested)
- Shared design system via `@ds` / `shared/design-system*` — preserve tokens, components, and brand
- `lucide-react` for icons
- `recharts` for charts / KPI visuals
- `@tanstack/react-query` for server state
- Playwright for e2e and visual checks (staging only)

## When redesigning admin / client portals

- Prefer shadcn/ui + Radix patterns as reference for blocks (dashboards, sidebars, dialogs), adapted to `@ds` — do not rip out the existing design system without an explicit ask
- Prefer TanStack Table for dense WMS data grids (sorting, filtering, column visibility, virtualization)
- Use shadcn Blocks / Creative Tim blocks as layout reference for admin chrome, not as a brand swap
- Keep RTL / Arabic support intact; do not hard-code LTR-only layouts

## Quality bar

- WCAG AA contrast for body/secondary text; tap targets ≥ 44px on mobile
- One clear primary CTA per toolbar; destructive actions must not look like primary CTAs
- Tables are the product: prioritize density, scanability, sticky headers, and filter clarity over marketing layouts
- Smoke-test on staging only: `staging-admin.emdadsy.com`, `staging-client.emdadsy.com`, port `3001`
